TIPS WHEN RUNNING IN COPILOT
Start each step in a fresh chat if Copilot’s context fills up. Paste the Reference Card
(Step 0) first, then say “Here are the records generated so far” and paste the running
CSV, then run the next step’s prompt.
After each step, download the CSV chunk before moving on — don’t trust Copilot to
remember it perfectly across steps.
If Copilot truncates a CSV mid-row, ask: “Continue the CSV from row N” (give the last
employee_id it completed).
Merge all 7 CSV chunks into one master file before running Step 8.